cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: peer-reviewer-finder
abstract: >-
  A tool that recommends well-matched, conflict-free, and diverse peer reviewers
  for a manuscript in human resource development and adjacent fields, using the
  OpenAlex scholarly database. It screens conflicts of interest and proposes an
  institution- and country-diverse, relevance-ranked panel to support journal
  editors.
type: software
